flowchart TD
    A([Start: Review Lab 07 Experiment Plan]) --> B[Prepare HallPass MVP v1.0]
    B --> C[Select Test Users<br/>First-year, International, Exchange,<br/>Senior Student, Administrator]
    C --> D[Explain Test Purpose and Give Neutral Instructions]
    D --> E[Assign HallPass Validation Tasks]

    E --> E1[Browse Dormitory Reviews]
    E --> E2[Browse Cafeteria Reviews]
    E --> E3[Read Campus Guide]
    E --> E4[View Review Details]
    E --> E5[Submit a Review]
    E --> E6[Admin Reviews or Moderates Content]

    E1 --> F[Observe User Actions]
    E2 --> F
    E3 --> F
    E4 --> F
    E5 --> F
    E6 --> F

    F --> G[Collect Structured Feedback<br/>Task Completion, Ease of Use,<br/>Usefulness, Interest, Confusion Points]
    G --> H[Record Results in<br/>validation-results.csv and .xlsx]
    H --> I[Check Data Quality<br/>Tester ID, Task, Score, Requirement ID]

    I --> J{Are Records Complete<br/>and Consistent?}

    J -- No --> K[Correct Missing or Inconsistent Data]
    K --> I

    J -- Yes --> L[Calculate Analytics Metrics]

    L --> L1[Total Test Users]
    L --> L2[Task Success Rate]
    L --> L3[Average Feedback Score]
    L --> L4[Average Interest Level]
    L --> L5[Most Common Confusion Point]

    L1 --> M[Compare Results with Success Criteria]
    L2 --> M
    L3 --> M
    L4 --> M
    L5 --> M

    M --> N{Did HallPass Meet<br/>the Success Criteria?}

    N -- Yes --> O[Decision: Continue with Minor Revisions]
    N -- Partly --> P[Decision: Revise Key Features]
    N -- No --> Q[Decision: Collect More Evidence<br/>or Redesign the MVP]

    O --> R[Document Customer Validation Summary]
    P --> R
    Q --> R

    R --> S[Write Analytics Insights]
    S --> T[Write MVP Decision Document]
    T --> U[Create GitHub Issues for Improvements]
    U --> V[Update README and Weekly Logbook]
    V --> W([Proceed to the Next Prototype Iteration])
